# Naga Fleshcrafter: the renew ability targets Memnite; in response Bot2 Lightning Bolts it, so the target is illegal as the
# ability resolves and none of it happens (CR 608.2b): no counter, and Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer, the other creature Bot1
# controls, does not become a copy of anything. The Naga stays exiled: exiling it was the cost. Set up as in the
# neighbouring scenario, with Bot2 holding a Mox Ruby and a Lightning Bolt.

